**Clarifying response variable categories**

The response variables are derived from resting-state fMRI dynamic functional connectivity, specifically average functional connectivity strength (a-FCS) and fluctuation characteristic (f-FCS), so labeling them under dynamic FC and FC-strength categories makes the most sense. Including resting-state FC as a broader category is also appropriate given the data source.
